        "noteText": "USA ESTA REQUIREMENTS FOR USA INCLUDING DURING TRANSIT-\n\nBritish Citizens must hold an electronic passport with an integrated chip, ESTA’s \nare valid for 2 years so we recommend you obtain one as soon as possible and \nno later than 72 hours before your flight is schedule to depart.\n\nU.S. Customs and Border Protection have advised that changes in ESTA \napplication processing mean real-time (on the day) approvals will no longer be \navailable.\n\nESTA's are for stays in the USA for up to 90 days, or for transiting through.\nVisit - https://esta.cbp.dhs.gov/esta for more information and to purchase your \nESTA. On occasion, depending on your prior travel history you may not be \neligible for an ESTA and will need to apply for a visa, \nplease visit https://esta.cbp.dhs.gov/esta for more information.",
